   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "## 1. Decision Trees as Interpretable Models\n\n### 1(a) Loading the Acute Inflammations data\n\n`diagnosis.data` is UTF-16 encoded, whitespace-separated, and writes temperatures with a decimal comma (e.g., `35,5`). It has 120 patients, 6 features (temperature and 5 yes/no symptoms), and 2 yes/no diagnoses: inflammation of the urinary bladder and nephritis of renal pelvis origin.",
