   "source": "### 2(b) Non-predictive features, train/test split, and imputation\n\nThe first 5 columns (`state`, `county`, `community`, `communityname`, `fold`) are described as non-predictive and are dropped. The first 1495 rows form the training set and the remaining 499 the test set. The target is `ViolentCrimesPerPop`.",
