   "source": "22 police-related (LEMAS) features are missing in 1256 of 1495 training rows (84%), and `OtherPerCap` is missing in one row. I imputed with the **median**, which is robust to the skewed distributions in this data. The imputer is **fit on the training data only** and then applied to the test data, so no information from the test set leaks into the model. For the police features, 84% of values become the same median after imputation, so they carry little real information.",
